<title>UK: Arson seen cause of Eurotunnel fire - source.</title>
<headline>Arson seen cause of Eurotunnel fire - source.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arson is now seen as the mostly likely cause of last November's Channel Tunnel fire which caused 200 million pounds in damage, sources close to the British side of the investigation told Reuters on Friday.</p>
<p>The French inquiry into the cause of the fire is due to give its findings in a press conference next week and British investigating officials believe arson will be named as the cause.</p>
</text>
